[16]="700346FD\n1\tStudy Gléowine's map and complete 'Interlude: Many Worries'\tYour mind travels far as you study the map, musing on the fate of Halbarad and the Grey Company.\n",
[17]="70059299\n1\tComplete 'Mission: The Further Adventures of Bilbo Baggins, Chapter 10'\tYour mission is to free Bilbo Baggins from the goblins. Speak to Celeblír to set forth!\n2\tTalk to Celeblír\tCeleblír is west of the Last Homely House, near the Town Crier.\n3\tTalk to Bilbo in the Hall of Fire\tBilbo Baggins is back in the Hall of Fire, in the Last Homely House.\n",
