[25]="70060FAE\n1\tMeet up with the Boffins outside Angelica's new home on Honeymead Lane\tDinodas and the other Boffins agreed to meet you outside Angelica's new home in Nobottle, on Honeymead Lane.\n2\tTalk to Dinodas Boffin on Honeymead Lane\tDinodas stands outside Angelica's new home on Honeymead Lane, very pleased with himself.\n3\tTalk to Prisca Boffin on Honeymead Lane\tPrisca Boffin and many of her children gather on Honeymead Lane to welcome Angelica to her new home.\n4\tTalk to Bingo Boffin on Honeymead Lane\tBingo Boffin stands on Honeymead Lane with his cousin Prisca and some of her children.\n5\tTalk to Angelica Boffin outside her new home\tAngelica Boffin is delighted to see that you and so much of her family has come to Nobottle to welcome her to her new home.\n6\tTalk to Dinodas outside 9 Honeymead Lane\tDinodas stands alone outside 9 Honeymead Lane.\n",
[26]="70048C7E\n1\tFind an altar\tOrc altars can be found in northern Agarnaith. You should find an Orc altar.\n2\tLie downon an altar\tOrc altars can be found in northern Agarnaith. You should try lying down on an altar.\n3\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be called with the goblin-caller. You should talk to Viznak.\n",
[27]="70065DAD\n1\tShoo badgers around the river Erui away (total: 12)\tCrithon has asked you to drive away badgers around the river Erui south-west of Imloth Melui.\n2\tTalk to Crithon\tThe badger problem has been addressed. You should report your progress to Crithon. Crithon is in Imloth Melui.\n3\tTalk to Arlach\tCrithon has asked you to deliver your report to Arlach. Arlach can be found in Arnach.\n",
[28]="70017579\n1\tDefeat Bidroi\tThe Orc Bidroi can be found on the bottom floor of the Second Hall where he fell from befuddlement. The Second Hall is north of the Foundations of Stone and east of Zelem-Melek. Celofa looks forward to sharing some new skills as an advanced Burglar, but has first tasked you with a simple deed: to defeat the Orc Bidroi.\n2\tReturn to Celofa\tCelofa can be found in the Shadowed Refuge in the northern reaches of the Foundations of Stone in Moria. Now that you've defeated Bidroi, you should return to Celofa so that she may begin to teach you her advanced Burglar skills.\n",
[29]="70053392\n1\tDefeat half-orcs and ruffians at Sharkey's Slough (total: 20)\tHalf-orcs and ruffians can be found at Sharkey's Slough in the Gladden Fields. Half-orcs and ruffians loyal to Sharkey have begun to use dredging machines Saruman long ago abandoned on the Gladden Fields to begin a new search.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many half-orcs and ruffians at Sharkey's Slough.\n",
[30]="70044D52\n1\tThe Stone Theatre can be found in the northern section of the First Circle. Polla Stoutley has asked you to shoo away workers from the stage in the Stone Theatre so that her band can practice without distraction.\t\n2\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith. You have shooed away the workers in the Stone Theatre and should now return to Polla.\n3\tSearch for Góthrik in the Wheel and Cask tavern\tThe Wheel and Cask can be found to the north-east in the First Circle of Minas Tirith. Polla has asked you to seek out her band's stagehand, Góthrik, who hasn't been seen since they arrived in Minas Tirith.\n4\tTalk to Góthrik\tGóthrik can be found inside the Wheel and Cask tavern in the First Circle of Minas Tirith. You have found Góthrik in the Wheel and Cask, and should now ask him to return to aid the Cloudyheads in setting up their new performance.\n5\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith. Góthrik has decided to quit working with the Cloudyheads and has asked you to inform Polla of his resignation.\n6\tTalk to Gord Dunley\030Talk to Robbo Gristback\030Talk to Daenar\030Talk to Fróki\030Talk to Hollur\tThe other members of the Cloudyheads can be found near the entrance of the Stone Theatre. Polla has asked you to introduce yourself to the band before taking over Góthrik's duties.\n7\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith. You have introduced yourself to the Cloudyheads and should now return to Polla.\n",
[31]="7001AD22\n1\tDestroy Orc-banners (total: 6)\tOrkish war-banners can be found in Krul Lugu below Iavassúl's Watch. Iavassúl has asked you to destroy several of the Orcs' war-banners to demoralize the Enemy.\n2\tTalk to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch\tIavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch, above Krul Lugu. You should return to Iavassúl and inform him that the Orkish banners have been destroyed.\n",
[32]="7006832A\n1\tDefeat spiders in Maj Khibi (total: 8)\tHûrlub the Bellower seems like a gentle creature. He has asked you to defeat spiders in Maj Khibi.\n2\tTalk to Hûrlub the Bellower\tThe spiders should be less likely to bother Hûrlub now. You should speak to Hûrlub in Phadâl Bimai. Phadâl Bimai can be found at the northern coast of Jeb Khâtel.\n",
